msgid "Manage channel bookmarks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/_static/badges/all-commercial.rst:7
msgid ""
"|plans-img-yellow| Available on `Entry, Professional, Enterprise, and "
"Enterprise Advanced plans <https://mattermost.com/pricing/>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:6
msgid "plans-img-yellow"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:7
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v10.1, you can bookmark up to 50 links or files to the "
"top of channels for quick and easy access, unless your system admin has "
"disabled your ability to do so. Bookmarks display directly under channel "
"headers. Files added as channel bookmarks are also :doc:`searchable "
"</end-user-guide/collaborate/search-for-messages>` in Mattermost."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:10
msgid "Open a bookmark"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:12
msgid ""
"Opening a channel bookmark works the same way as selecting a file link or"
" attachment in a message. Select or tap a bookmark to view the file or "
"link."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:14
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v10.11, bookmarks containing ``mattermost://`` links open"
" directly in the desktop app using deep linking. This turns bookmarks "
"into one-click shortcuts to channels, threads, or messages, letting you "
"jump straight to key assets in Mattermost quickly and easily."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:17
msgid "Add a bookmark"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:21
msgid ""
"From Mattermost v10.5, select the channel name at the top of the center "
"pane to access the drop-down menu, and select **Bookmarks Bar** to add a "
"link or attach a file. In Mattermost versions prior to v10.5, select "
"**Add a bookmark** in the bookmarks bar instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:23
msgid ""
"Select **Add a link** to specify the link URL, specify bookmark text, and"
" an optional bookmark icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:24
msgid ""
"Select **Attach a file** to select a file, specify bookmark text, and an "
"optional bookmark icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:28
msgid "The bookmarks bar is hidden when a channel has no bookmarks."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:30
msgid "In a channel, select the **More** |more-icon-vertical| icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:50
msgid ""
"Use the More icon in the top left corner to access Mattermost desktop "
"apps customization settings."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:32
msgid "Tap on More options to access available options for the channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:36
msgid "Select **View info**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:38
msgid "Tap on View info to view additional information about the channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:42
msgid "Tap on **Add a bookmark** to add the first bookmark."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:44
msgid "Tap on Add a bookmark to add the first bookmark."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:48
msgid ""
"For subsequent bookmarks, select the **Plus** |plus| icon in the "
"bookmarks bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:31
msgid "The Plus icon provides access to channel and direct message functionality."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:50
msgid "Tap on the Plus icon to add more bookmarks to the channel."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:54
msgid ""
"You can either select **Add a link** to specify the link URL, specify "
"bookmark text, and an optional bookmark icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:56
msgid "Tap on Add a link to add a Bookmark link."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:60
msgid ""
"Or you can select **Add a file** to select a file, specify bookmark text,"
" and an optional bookmark icon."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:62
msgid "Tap on Add a file to add a file as Bookmark."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:66
msgid "Tap on **Save**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:69
msgid "Manage bookmarks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:71
msgid ""
"You can `edit <#edit-bookmarks>`__ and `delete <#delete-bookmarks>`__ "
"bookmarks, as well as `copy bookmark links <#copy-bookmark-links>`__. "
"Additionally, web and desktop users can `reorder bookmarks <#reorder-"
"bookmarks>`__, and mobile users can `share bookmarks <#share-"
"bookmarks>`__. Changes to bookmarks are visible to all channel members."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:74
msgid "Reorder bookmarks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:76
msgid ""
"Using Mattermost in a web browser or the desktop app, drag bookmarks to "
"reorder them in the bookmarks bar. Reordering channel bookmarks changes "
"the display order for all channel members."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:80
msgid "You can't reorder channel bookmarks using the mobile app."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:83
msgid "Edit bookmarks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:85
msgid ""
"You can make changes to the bookmark link or file, the bookmark title, or"
" the optional bookmark icon. Editing a bookmark changes the bookmark for "
"all channel members."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:89
msgid ""
"Select the **More** |more-icon| icon next to a bookmark and select "
"**Edit**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../<rst_prolog>:16
msgid "Use the More icon to access additional message options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:93
msgid "Long-press on a bookmark and select **Edit**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:95
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:117
#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:134
msgid "Tap and hold a bookmark name to explore more options."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:100
msgid "Share bookmarks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:102
msgid "Using the mobile app, long-press on a bookmark and select **Share**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:105
msgid "Copy bookmark links"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:107
msgid ""
"You can copy bookmark links when your system admin has :ref:`enabled your"
" ability to do so <administration-guide/configure/site-configuration-"
"settings:enable public file links>`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:111
msgid ""
"Select the **More** |more-icon| icon next to a bookmark and select **Copy"
" link**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:115
msgid "Long-press on a bookmark and select **Copy link**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:122
msgid "Delete bookmarks"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:124
msgid "Deleting a channel bookmark deletes it for all channel members."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:128
msgid ""
"Select the **More** |more-icon| icon next to a bookmark and select "
"**Delete**."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/end-user-guide/collaborate/manage-channel-bookmarks.rst:132
msgid "Long-press on a bookmark and select **Delete**."
msgstr ""

